  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/mod/2020/361/13329231_l.webp\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\">𝔹𝕠𝕤𝕤 𝕄𝕦𝕤𝕚𝕔 𝕄𝕠𝕕</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這是一個專注於在玩家與凋靈和終界龍進行激烈遭遇戰時搭配背景音樂的模組。說真的，功能大概就是這樣了。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>您可以透過遊戲內選單的「選項」&gt;「音樂與音效」中的「唱機/音符盒」滑桿來調整本模組的背景音樂音量。</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800080\"><strong>您也可以執行兩個不同的指令來切換（開啟/關閉）本模組的首領主題音樂。</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#936\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#936\"><em><strong>/trigger bmm.wither_theme.toggle </strong></em>用於切換凋靈的首領主題音樂</span></span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#936\"><em><strong>/trigger bmm.ender_dragon_theme.toggle </strong></em>用於切換終界龍的首領主題音樂</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><span><span style=\"font-size:24px\">音樂</span><br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0ZdAuyYBVC4\" rel=\"nofollow\">84tangelo - The Wither (凋靈主題)</a></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0ZdAuyYBVC4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GAW5tuC83mE\" rel=\"nofollow\">solunary - The \"End\" At Hand (終界龍主題)</a></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GAW5tuC83mE?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如何解決「出生點播放音樂」的問題</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>您可能安裝了 <strong>Dynamic Surroundings</strong>。別擔心，完全不需要從您的模組列表中直接移除它。相反地，您可以依照以下步驟來解決這個問題，同時保留 Dynamic Surroundings。<em>祝好運！</em></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T0fpHUYm9zE_luBFx0mNjUFQxZxxc6drXSR_lBbBJCc/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T0fpHUYm9zE_luBFx0mNjUFQxZxxc6drXSR_lBbBJCc/edit?usp=sharing</a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
